# Description: Detects all variations of obfuscated powershell IEX invocation code generated by Invoke-Obfuscation framework from the following code block
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:/\$PSHome\[\s*\d{1,3}\s*\]\s*\+\s*\$PSHome\[/) OR (process.command_line:/\$ShellId\[\s*\d{1,3}\s*\]\s*\+\s*\$ShellId\[/) OR (process.command_line:/\$env:Public\[\s*\d{1,3}\s*\]\s*\+\s*\$env:Public\[/) OR (process.command_line:/\$env:ComSpec\[(?:\s*\d{1,3}\s*,){2}/) OR (process.command_line:/\*mdr\*\W\s*\)\.Name/) OR (process.command_line:/\$VerbosePreference\.ToString\(/) OR (process.command_line:/\[String\]\s*\$VerbosePreference/))
